            string/status columns (Department, Status) open in Values by default; numeric/date open in Condition;
            boolean shows its tri-state. This table pins <code>FilterApplyMode="FilterApplyMode.Apply"</code> (Clear&nbsp;all / Apply footer); the default is now <code>Live</code>. Set <code>FilterSidebarSide="FilterSidebarSide.Right"</code>,
