            via <strong>Columns</strong>. Left-docked here (<code>Placement="SlicerPlacement.Left"</code>); the
            panel also supports Right / Top / Bottom. Session-only state (a <code>Persist</code> parameter is
            now wired via <code>Persist="true" PreferenceKey="sg-slicer-panel"</code> — your Hide/Show + column choices survive reload). With no options it would auto-derive candidates from the
            table's filterable columns.</p>

        <div style="display:flex;gap:16px;align-items:flex-start;">
            @if (_filtersOpen)
            {
            <LipiSlicerPanel TItem="DemoStaff" FilterState="_panelState" Items="@_staff"
                             Title="Filters" Placement="SlicerPlacement.Left" Collapsible="false"
                             Persist="true" PreferenceKey="sg-slicer-panel">
                <LipiSlicerOption TItem="DemoStaff" TValue="string" Field="@(s => s.Department)"
